error[exhaustive-union-default]: default case is not allowed when all boolean values are covered in union `BoolUnion`
   ┌ test.idl:2:1
   │
 2 │ union BoolUnion switch(boolean) {
   · ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ exhausted all possible values
 3 │ case TRUE:
 4 │ case FALSE:
 5 │ default:
 6 │     boolean my_value;
 7 │ };
   · ^^
   └──
 help: both 'true' and 'false' are already handled by explicit cases
 note: default cases are only allowed when some discriminator values are not explicitly handled
